WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.240
[Music builds over photos from Mike's life]

2
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.290
He is a fighter, literally.

3
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:24.690
He holds a seventh-degree black belt in karate and high ranks in jiu-jitsu and kickboxing.

4
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.290
It's not how many times you get knocked down. It's getting back up after each time.

5
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.490
Kaizen is a Japanese word that means continuous improvement.

6
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:40.890
Growth becomes exponential. It's like a snowflake that turns into a snowball, and eventually turns into a snowman.

7
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:48.440
I'm a big student. I don't like to say I'm a master of anything or I'm great at anything. I'm a big student of everything.

8
00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:52.090
I've turned down over a hundred thousand dollars worth of perm fees in my career.

9
00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:56.090
Integrity is more important than the placement. The relationship is more important than the placement.

10
00:00:56.140 --> 00:01:02.910
So many people get caught up in two words: wins and losses. I've learned to turn the word loss into lesson.

11
00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:06.760
A lot of times, energy management is more important than time management.

12
00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:11.480
It's not a failed experiment. It's not a failed effort unless you stop trying.

13
00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:14.530
I would ask you to introspectively look at yourself, at who you are today,

14
00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:19.480
and what do you have to do to close the gap to be a better version of yourself tomorrow?

15
00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.480
Thank you so much. I appreciate it.

16
00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:25.830
[Applause]
